{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45515","headline":"哭贾岛 · 可止","name":"哭贾岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕生松雪地，蜀死葬山根。\n诗僻降今古，官卑悞子孙。\n塚栏寒月色，人哭苦吟魂。\n墓雨滴碑字，年年添藓痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可止","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}